 1→//! Decision Logic Module
 2→//!
 3→//! Pure decision/inference functions that determine WHAT should be in a token.
 4→//! Returns data structures (TokenDecision, DelegationDecision) that describe the decision.
 5→//! NO crypto calls - just logic for determining capabilities, facts, expiry, audience.
 6→//!
 7→//! These functions are replaceable - they could later be implemented in OCaml
